===choicehumanintro===
Clara: Well, you’re in the right place… but he isn’t here at the moment. He went to visit my mentor, Ada. #portrait:Clara
Amelia: By the way, what’s that thing in your hair? #portrait:AmeliaSilly
Narrator: Its a strange creaure that could roughly fit into one's hands, with a fluffy cotton-like coat. 
Clara: These little things? We use their wool to make thread! They don't talk much though, so don't mind them. #portrait:Clara
Clara: While you're waiting for Cillain, why don't I give you a tour of town? #portrait:Clara
